// Raft scenario "election": election timeouts, in steps of silence, a 9 (the first leader does not compete again
// within the bound), b 2, c 4; the client submits nothing. When a's messages stop reaching b and c, both can become
// candidates for term 2. Blossom golden corpus, re-derived (derived = true); see ../../README.md.

patience("a", 9)@1;
patience("b", 2)@1;
patience("c", 4)@1;
